Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,what the f***?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.20,0:00:02.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,could victor wembanyama
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.24,0:00:03.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,beat five giraffes?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.88,0:00:04.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,except these giraffes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:05.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,are the only players
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.86,0:00:06.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,on earth who
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.66,0:00:07.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,look down at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.86,0:00:08.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,on wednesday, wemby
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.86,0:00:10.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,dropped 52 points,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.50,0:00:11.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,24 rebounds, and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.70,0:00:13.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,eight blocks on dallas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.54,0:00:14.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.24,0:00:15.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,he went one for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.06,0:00:16.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,eight from three and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.08,0:00:17.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,still finished plus 23
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.86,0:00:19.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,in a one-point game.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.48,0:00:20.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,so the spurs fly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.48,0:00:21.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,him to the savanna
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.18,0:00:22.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,for a real test.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.84,0:00:23.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,tip-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.66,0:00:24.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,wemby wins
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.10,0:00:24.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,the jump ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.76,0:00:26.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,the giraffe eats it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.46,0:00:27.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,pick-and-roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.24,0:00:27.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,the giraffes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.82,0:00:29.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,switch everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.20,0:00:29.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,wemby rises
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.68,0:00:31.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,for his fadeaway.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.12,0:00:31.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,blocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.66,0:00:32.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,by a neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.72,0:00:33.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,he tries a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.24,0:00:34.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,lob to himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.38,0:00:35.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,the giraffe eats it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.76,0:00:36.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,drop coverage?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.68,0:00:37.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,they don't drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.76,0:00:38.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,they're already up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.96,0:00:39.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,at halftime, the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.86,0:00:40.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,studio crew calls
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.74,0:00:41.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,it the greatest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.44,0:00:43.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,defense in nba history.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.64,0:00:44.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,the defense is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.50,0:00:46.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,chewing a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.02,0:00:46.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,fourth quarter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.94,0:00:47.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,down one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.68,0:00:48.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,eight seconds left.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.92,0:00:49.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,wemby drives baseline,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.92,0:00:51.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,rises, and dunks on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.48,0:00:52.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,a giraffe who
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.10,0:00:53.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,fell asleep standing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.86,0:00:54.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,and one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.80,0:00:55.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,he walks
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.12,0:00:56.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,to the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.30,0:00:56.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,19 for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.82,0:00:58.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,23 on wednesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.60,0:00:59.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,ice cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.84,0:01:00.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,swish.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.56,0:01:02.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,final score, wemby 52.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.82,0:01:04.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,giraffes 51.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.30,0:01:04.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,after the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.62,0:01:05.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,game, the mavericks
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.46,0:01:06.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,sign two giraffes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.96,0:01:07.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,they still
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.28,0:01:07.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,lose by one.
